    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math practical but not deeply passionate about it. As someone with upper secondary education, I use it daily in economics and gardening calculations but don’t dive into complex theory. My parents’ education background—where one had no formal schooling—shaped my pragmatic approach to problem-solving without the academic rigor I admire in others.",
