    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used a calculator app to check algebra homework. It was helpful for verifying steps but didn’t replace my understanding. I appreciated the quick results for simple problems but preferred manual work for deeper learning, especially since I didn’t pursue advanced math beyond high school.",
